BatchInsertItems.requestParamsDescription:
The following fields of product information are used to match template display, in descending order of priority:  

- TemplateSceneId: attempts to match a custom template;  
- InventoryStatus: attempts to match an out-of-stock template;  
- BeMember: attempts to match a membership template;  
- BeSourceCode && BePromotion: attempts to match a marketing template;  
- BeSourceCode: attempts to match a traceability template;  
- BePromotion: attempts to match a promotion template;  
- BeClearance: attempts to match a clearance template;
